# Design System: "The Shopkeeper's Ledger"

The site has ONE visual identity: receipts, ledgers, mono labels, dashed rules. Pages are assembled from existing pieces, never invented per-page.

## Building blocks (import from `@/components/marketing`)

| Component | Use for |
| --- | --- |
| `LedgerHero` | Page hero: eyebrow, title + highlight, subtitle, actions, stamp |
| `LedgerHeading` | Section heading with mono eyebrow annotation |
| `ReceiptCard` | Feature/pain/step cards (code, title, description, footer) |
| `LedgerCta` | Closing call-to-action band |
| `FaqSection` | FAQ accordion (pair with `schemaTemplates.faqPage`) |
| `ComparisonTable` / `PlanMatrix` | Ledger-style tables with `[✓]` / `[✗]` markers |

## Conventions

- Section eyebrows: `` `${tLedger('no')} 01 · ${t('section.badge')}` `` (middle dot separator, zero-padded numbers)
- Section wrapper: `<section className="section-padding-sm">` with `<div className="container-wide">`; alternate bands add `ledger-rules border-y border-border`
- Receipt-style text uses `font-receipt`; mono micro-labels use `mono-label`
- CTA links point to `/register` (localized: `/ar/register`); demo requests go to `/contact`
- No new hex colors in pages; tokens live in `globals.css`
- Icons/markers: `[✓]` included, `[✗]` not included, `***` for receipt end lines
